# Kingshot Bot Setup Guide

This Kingshot Bot setup guide explains how to start using GnBots for Kingshot automation.

Unlike traditional GitHub bots, GnBots does not require Python scripts, emulators, APK files, or a PC running 24/7. GnBots is a cloud-based Kingshot Bot built to automate the repetitive parts of the game from an online dashboard.

## Official Kingshot Bot

Use the official GnBots Kingshot Bot here:

https://www.gnbots.com/shop/kingshot-bot/

## What You Need

To use GnBots Kingshot Bot, you need:

* A Kingshot account
* Access to your Kingshot account email or login method
* An active GnBots account or free trial
* A web browser on any device

You do not need:

* A PC
* An emulator
* Python
* GitHub code
* Downloads
* APK mods

## Step 1: Create Your GnBots Account

Start by visiting the official Kingshot Bot page:

https://www.gnbots.com/shop/kingshot-bot/

Create your account and start the free trial or choose a plan.

## Step 2: Connect Your Kingshot Account

After logging into GnBots, connect your Kingshot account.

Follow the account connection instructions provided in your GnBots dashboard. You do not need to install files or run scripts from GitHub.

## Step 3: Choose Your Automation Features

Once your account is connected, select the Kingshot automation tasks you want to run.

Available features may include:

* Auto Farming
* Resource Gathering
* Building Upgrades
* Troop Training
* Daily Task Automation
* Resource Collection
* Account Management
* 24/7 Cloud Automation

## Step 4: Start The Bot

After selecting your features, start the bot from the GnBots dashboard.

Because GnBots runs in the cloud, your automation can continue even when your computer or phone is turned off.

## GitHub Bot Setup vs Cloud Bot Setup

Most Kingshot GitHub bots require a more complicated setup process.

A typical GitHub bot may require:

* Downloading files
* Installing Python
* Setting up dependencies
* Running an Android emulator
* Keeping your PC online
* Fixing issues after game updates

GnBots avoids that setup by running from the cloud.

## Why Use GnBots Instead Of A Public GitHub Bot?

Public GitHub bots vary in quality, maintenance, and reliability.

GnBots is built for players who want a Kingshot Bot without spending hours
